{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Big Revival of the Funny Pair! The Beauty Fallen from the Sky\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"1991-04-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A plane carrying drugs and a wanted woman crashes into Ryo's apartment which forces him and Kaori to sleep on the same bed.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72877/332595.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"迷コンビ大復活! 空から舞いおりた美女\"},{\"title\":\"Farewell, Kaori! Arrest Warrant for the City Hunter\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"1991-05-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kaori overhears a phone conversation between Ryo and Saeko after which she realises that she has rented her room to a detective whose motive is to arrest Ryo.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72877/332596.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"さらば香! シティーハンター逮捕指令\"},{\"title\":\"Combination of puzzlement & recovery! Memories are a distant light\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"1991-05-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ryo comes across a stuntwoman named Yuki who is trying to get her memory back by performing dangerous stunts. She believes Yuki is being hypnotised by someone.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72877/1499741.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"危険を買う美女! 想い出は光の彼方に\"},{\"title\":\"Love is also an A-license. The beautiful wheelman visiting the store!\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"1991-05-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ryo is chased by the police as they think he is the underwear thief. He escapes with the help of Miyuki.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72877/332598.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"恋もA級ライセンス 美人逃がし屋参上!\"},{\"title\":\"Fear! Shinjuku Ghost Story!! The Wandering Soul of a Beautiful Woman\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"1991-06-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ryo stumbles upon a pretty ghost named Ami Asaka who tells him that she was murdered by a serial killer. She hires him to protect her younger sister.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72877/332599.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"恐怖!新宿怪談!! さまよえる美女の魂\"},{\"title\":\"Farewell Requiem Your Visage, Once Again\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"1991-06-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ryo comes clean about the fact that he pretended to be Ami's fiance to get close to Mami which infuriates her. She gets a letter from Ami who asks her to trust him.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72877/332600.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"別れのレクイエム あの面影をもう一度\"},{\"title\":\"That Hayato Ijuin`s Extremely Peaceful Day\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"1991-07-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Umibozu's saves three young girls from mean bikers and they come to his cafe to thank him. They want to start a fan club for him.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72877/332601.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"あの 伊集院隼人氏の 極めて 平穏な一日\"},{\"title\":\"Revenge of the beautiful woman! The sorrowful blues for Ryo\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"1991-07-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sonia wants to avenge her father's death and she asks Umibozu to kill Ryo.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72877/332602.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"復讐の美女! リョウに哀しみのブルースを\"},{\"title\":\"The Place Where Gun Smoke Goes. City Hunter Dies at Dawn\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"1991-08-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ryo and Umibozu fight at a graveyard while Sonia learns about the challenge between her father and Ryo from Miki.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72877/332603.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"硝煙の行方... シティーハンター暁に死す!\"},{\"title\":\"My Love For Tonight Only Cinderella Story in the City\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"1991-09-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While shopping with Ryo, Kaori meets her friend, Eriko who is a fashion designer. Eriko gives Kaori a makeover and set up a date for her with Ryo.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72877/332604.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"今夜だけこの愛を... 都会のシンデレラ物語(ストーリー)\"},{\"title\":\"A Trigger Covered with Scratches! Detective Saeko Loved\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"1991-10-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Saeko meets her ex-lover Asakura who is an agent from Interpol. He asks for her help to apprehend a murder suspect who has escaped to Japan.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72877/332605.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"傷だらけのトリガー! 冴子が愛した刑事\"},{\"title\":\"Memories of the Necklace Incident? Ryo, A Bad Girl & Makimura\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"1991-10-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ryo sees the news about Queen Rika's divorce and recalls the past when she approached him for help to steal Meraldo Kingdom's treasure, a necklace.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72877/332606.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"追憶の首飾り事件! リョウと悪女と槙村と\"},{\"title\":\"Lullaby requiem. The young nobleman who came from a distant country\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"1991-10-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kaori befriends an Austrian orphan, Hans Zeigfried who is a professional killer and dying from a fatal disease. Kaori is abducted by Hans' enemies.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72877/332607.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"鎮魂のララバイ 遠い国から来た貴公子\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}